rst Historical Society and Museum Responses | Town of Amherst","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2016-01-29","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Verify the museum’s current public hours and admission information before going inside.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jones-library","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Jones Library","title":"Use Jones Library’s temporary branch","subtitle":"University Drive corridor, Amherst","notes":"Visit the active temporary library at 101 University Drive for full services while the Amity Street building is renovated.","short_summary":"Amherst’s public library is operating from a temporary University Drive location.","evidence_claim":"Jones Library states that it is open at 101 University Drive and offering full library services while its 43 Amity Street site is renovated.","source_url":"https://www.joneslibrary.org/1015/Building-Updates","source_title":"Building Updates | Jones Library","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The library reports free parking in front of and behind the temporary location; confirm current service hours online.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"north-amherst-library","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"North Amherst Library","title":"Stop at North Amherst Library","subtitle":"Montague Road corridor, North Amherst","notes":"Visit the branch at 8 Montague Road and use its added community-room space; plan around the limited on-site parking.","short_summary":"A renovated North Amherst branch library with a community room.","evidence_claim":"The Town reports that the North Amherst Library at 8 Montague Road received an addition and renovation, including a community room.","source_url":"https://www.amherstma.gov/CivicAlerts.aspx?AID=3568&A